From 685dbceeb02b8ebc1390e406ca487143eb807a38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 19:03:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: keep xPON activation alive across netdev cycles

Discover the EN7523 GDM2 datapath when no Ethernet phandle is present.
Keep the Linux IRQ line enabled and use the GPON or EPON interrupt mask
registers to quiesce the MAC.

Do not tear down the optical PHY and protocol state machine when
userspace cycles pon0 while carrier is down. Keep activation running
until the optical module is removed or the driver is unloaded. This
allows GPON to reach O5 while netifd waits for service readiness.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
